# MNKYBOX external tree — no packages.
#
# The application is a rootfs overlay (prebuilt binaries + systemd units) and
# the Waveshare panel overlay is compiled from vendored source by
# board/mnkybox/post-build.sh, so this tree adds no Buildroot package.
# Configuration and board files live under configs/ and board/mnkybox/.
comment "MNKYBOX: application ships as a rootfs overlay, no packages here"
